      "has_readme": true,
      "readme_length": 1504,
      "readme_excerpt": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n# Projeto Portfólio Login - Aplicação Mobile React Native\n\n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  \n[![Generic badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/Made%20by-Alissu-purple.svg)](https://shields.io/) [![made-for-VSCode](https://img.shields.io/badge/Made%20for-VSCode-1f425f.svg)](https://code.visualstudio.com/) [![npm version](https://badge.fury.io/js/react-native.svg)](https://badge.fury.io/js/react-native)\n\n</div>\n\nAplicação Front-end Mobile desenvolvida em React Native para layout de Tela de Login para aplicativos diversos e adaptação de projetos anteriores, com animação no formulário no estilo estilingue, além do efeito de diminuir e aumentar o logotipo de acordo com o teclado aberto.\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n![login](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/48495838/[phone]a7d4a80-af26-11ea-98ae-9c8074e8e53e.png)\n\n</div>\n\n## :rocket: Tecnologias\n<ul>\n  <li>Expo</li>\n  <li>StatusBar</li>\n  <li>KeyboardAvoidingView</li>\n  <li>TextInput</li>\n  <li>TouchableOpacity</li>\n  <li>StyleSheet</li>\n  <li>Animated</li>\n  <li>Keyboard</li>\n  <li>useState</li>\n  <li>useEffect</li>\n</ul>\n\n## :arrow_forward: Start\n<ul>\n  <li>npm install</li>\n  <li>npm run start / npm start</",
